    "dueAt": "2026-10-26T04:00:00.000Z",
    "sentAt": "2026-10-26T04:00:25.931Z",
    "text": "There is a specific kind of silence that happens when you place a mirror and every single beam goes entirely off target.\n\n#Ringshift",
