    "status": "sent",
    "dueAt": "2026-10-24T04:00:00.000Z",
    "sentAt": "2026-10-24T04:00:16.790Z",
    "text": "Watching a source beam loop through three different portals before it finally touches the rim lock is oddly hypnotic.\n\n#Ringshift",
