    "status": "sent",
    "dueAt": "2026-10-23T04:00:00.000Z",
    "sentAt": "2026-10-23T04:00:30.358Z",
    "text": "There is a very thin line between strategically placing a block and accidentally trapping your own source beam inside the circle.\n\n#Ringshift",
